WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.952
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:08.265 --> 00:00:10.650
And so when I went
and showed up,

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:12.440
I showed up actually
in the wrong lobby.

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:13.915
And I was waiting in it
for 20 minutes, thinking,

00:00:13.915 --> 00:00:15.110
where is everybody?

00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:16.546
Why is nobody here?

00:00:16.546 --> 00:00:19.170
And then I get this frantic text
from one of the people saying,

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:20.253
oh, my god, where are you?

00:00:20.253 --> 00:00:21.760
We're about to shoot the video.

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:23.850
And I started school and
I remember the first day,

00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:24.900
I was so excited.

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:28.250
I got my notebook out
and my pencil bag,

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:29.334
and I had it on the table.

00:00:29.334 --> 00:00:31.666
Because I thought I was going
to learn to read and write

00:00:31.666 --> 00:00:32.655
that first day.

00:00:32.655 --> 00:00:33.860
So I was just ready.

00:00:33.860 --> 00:00:36.420
And then the whole day went by
and it was just introductions

00:00:36.420 --> 00:00:37.296
and stuff like that.

00:00:37.296 --> 00:00:40.050
And I was kind of sad
that it ended like that.

00:00:40.050 --> 00:00:42.597
Because I thought I was going
to learn to read and write

00:00:42.597 --> 00:00:43.180
the first day.

00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:45.417
So your expectation was
just like, that's it,

00:00:45.417 --> 00:00:48.000
you're going to be an adult, you
can do all these cool tricks.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:48.950
Yeah, I'm going to
go to school and I'm

00:00:48.950 --> 00:00:50.325
going to learn to
read and write.

00:00:50.325 --> 00:00:51.810
And I was just so excited.

00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:54.560
[MUSIC PLAYING]

